In-Reply-To: <5abc11d80801260453x52166bf7rfa11754a33d7128@mail.gmail.com>
References: <5abc11d80801260453x52166bf7rfa11754a33d7128@mail.gmail.com>
Message-ID: <Pine.LNX.4.64.0801260757390.24244@w5.hmdc.harvard.edu>


this is an interesting substantive question, but it is not answerable by 
any means precisely how you have proposed it.  you also need to specify 
WHICH 25% of women had abortions.  you'd get different answers if you 
chose different groups of 25%.  So just choose the ones you want to flip 
from 0s to 1s or to set at 0s and 1s, compute your predicted values and 
you're set.
Gary

